    "updated_at": "2017-04-11T16:46:37Z",
    "body": "This sounds like a browser bug in the color picker implementation you are experimenting with. If they count clicking within the color picker as a value change (which they don't have to), then it would only be consistent for them to count clicking the cancel button as a value change. You should definitely file browser bugs on wherever you're encountering this.",
