    "created_at": "2017-04-11T17:08:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-11T17:08:40Z",
    "body": "Well. Apparently I was hallucinating over the last couple days, because I just went and did it again and sure enough, the value during input events doesn't somehow revert if the color picker is aborted. I have no idea where I got this from. My apologies.\r\n\r\nThat said -- I think it actually would be useful if the color picker could be aborted like this, as long as it could be detected.",
